# Striking a Balance (ahtUrhgan 63): a level 75 Warrior in Whitegate. Wazyih (no script; default 699), Saliyahf (700);
# trigger area 9 (-103 0 -16 .. -100 0 -12), walked into after the zone-in lock; Al Zahbi's blank_striking_a_balance (no
# script; default NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY). Available: area 9: no handler: nothing; Wazyih, local Option 0: 684,
# finished: Option 1; Wazyih: 685; Saliyahf 686, finished: Option 0, begun. Prog 0: Saliyahf 687; Wazyih 688, finished:
# Prog 1. Prog 1: Saliyahf 687; Wazyih 689; area 9: 690, finished: Prog 2; area 9 again: nothing. Prog 2: Saliyahf,
# Option 0: 692, finished: Option 1; Saliyahf: 693; Wazyih 691, finished: Prog 3. Prog 3: Saliyahf 693; Wazyih 694; out
# to Al Zahbi and back (Option, a local var, cleared): Saliyahf 692, finished: Option 1; Saliyahf: 693. Al Zahbi: the
# blank: Prog 4, moved (its first spot is in no row: a row of 2-7 is drawn), the reply keyItem: Munahda's Package; the
# blank at its new spot: no Prog-4 handler: NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY. Whitegate at Prog 4: the zone-in's 695, finished:
# the package taken, Prog 5. Wazyih 697; Saliyahf 696, finished: completed (three Imperial Bronze Pieces); Saliyahf: no
# section: 700.
lists AhtUrhganWhitegate/Wazyih/onTrigger AhtUrhganWhitegate/Saliyahf/onTrigger AhtUrhganWhitegate/onTriggerAreaEnter/9 AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/684 AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/692 AhtUrhganWhitegate/onZoneIn/1 AlZahbi/blank_striking_a_balance/onTrigger AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/696
char zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=-92.5,-6,-93.455 job=WAR lvl=75
login
tick 1000
tick 1000
tick 1000                               # past the zone-in lock
walk -101.5,0,-14                       # area 9, available: no handler: nothing
walk -95,0,-20
trigger Wazyih                          # available, Option 0: 684
finish                                  # Option 1
trigger Wazyih                          # Option 1: 685
finish
trigger Saliyahf                        # available: 686
finish                                  # Option 0; begun
trigger Saliyahf                        # Prog 0: 687 (replaceEvent)
finish
trigger Wazyih                          # Prog 0: 688
finish                                  # Prog 1
trigger Saliyahf                        # Prog 1: 687
finish
trigger Wazyih                          # Prog 1: 689
finish
walk -95,0,-20
walk -101.5,0,-14                       # area 9, Prog 1: 690
finish                                  # Prog 2
walk -95,0,-20
walk -101.5,0,-14                       # area 9, Prog 2: nothing
trigger Saliyahf                        # Prog 2, Option 0: 692
finish                                  # Option 1
trigger Saliyahf                        # Option 1: 693
finish
trigger Wazyih                          # Prog 2: 691
finish                                  # Prog 3
trigger Saliyahf                        # Prog 3, Option 1: 693
finish
trigger Wazyih                          # Prog 3: 694
finish
warp -64,-7,38 AlZahbi
warp -58.4,0,64.855 AhtUrhganWhitegate  # Prog 3: no zone-in event; Option cleared
trigger Saliyahf                        # Prog 3, Option 0: 692
finish                                  # Prog 3's 692: Option 1
trigger Saliyahf                        # Prog 3, Option 1: 693
finish
warp -41.1,0,8.942 AlZahbi
trigger blank_striking_a_balance        # Prog 3: Prog 4; the blank moved; the package
finish-if-event
trigger blank_striking_a_balance        # its new spot; Prog 4: nil: NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY
warp -58.4,0,64.855 AhtUrhganWhitegate open   # Prog 4: 695
finish                                  # the package taken; Prog 5
trigger Wazyih                          # Prog 5: 697
finish
trigger Saliyahf                        # Prog 5: 696
finish                                  # completed: the bronze pieces
trigger Saliyahf                        # completed: no section: 700
finish
